{"ID":"20240118145021-x46xb8r","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145021-x46xb8r","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145021-x46xb8r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145021-wgdt1q9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160223-kbv8u62\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160223-kbv8u62\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:79,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:79\u0026#125;","title":"303闾茹兰茹304乌韭305鹿藿","type":"doc","updated":"20240122160232"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145021-wgdt1q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145021-wgdt1q9","updated":"20240122160157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蔺茹"}]},{"ID":"20240122160200-hlbexlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160200-hlbexlb","updated":"20240122160201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，寒，有小毒。主蚀恶肉，败疮，死肌，杀疥虫，排脓、恶血，除大风，热气，善忘，不乐。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160202-ssh0opx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160202-ssh0opx","updated":"20240122160204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乌韭"}]},{"ID":"20240122160205-g349q4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160205-g349q4a","updated":"20240122160211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，寒，无毒。治皮肤往来寒热，利小肠膀胱气。生山谷石上。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160211-vonaecs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160211-vonaecs","updated":"20240122160214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鹿藿"}]},{"ID":"20240122160214-qizlwfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160214-qizlwfa","updated":"20240122160219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治蛊毒，女子腰腹痛，不乐，肠痈，瘰疬，疡气。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160219-qausxvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160219-qausxvr"}},{"ID":"20240122160223-kbv8u62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160223-kbv8u62","updated":"20240122160232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三O三、三O四，还有三O五，哦，这些药都是已经失去了，很少。。。这个，象我们以前很多药，已经没有人可以认得了哦，我们很少用，哦，很少用，诸位看看就可以了。"}]}]}